{"2534170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Car Stunt Mania", "steam_appid": 2534170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run is different. Every crash is your fault.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car Stunt Mania is a physics-based endless racer with procedurally generated terrain. No two runs play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534170/extras/d64357d012b4328503f38d284173f1b5.poster.avif?t=1775641886\" aria-label=\"Yellow van catching big air and landing stunts on hilly terrain\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534170/extras/d64357d012b4328503f38d284173f1b5.webm?t=1775641886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534170/extras/d64357d012b4328503f38d284173f1b5.mp4?t=1775641886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive as far as you can without wrecking your car. Chain frontflips, backflips, long jumps and big airs into combos for bonus coins. Land on both wheels for a perfect landing. Every trick fills your nitro bar, and nitro launches you into even bigger stunts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 vehicles across 6 tiers. 5 environments. 40 upgrade points per car. The runs are short but the progression isn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534170/extras/035dc787b2272158a16efab680774148.poster.avif?t=1775641886\" aria-label=\"Red sports car spinning mid-air and using slam-down for a great landing in the desert\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534170/extras/035dc787b2272158a16efab680774148.webm?t=1775641886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534170/extras/035dc787b2272158a16efab680774148.mp4?t=1775641886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's in the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 24 vehicles, from hatchbacks to trucks to sports cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5 themed environments: Summer, Spring, Autumn, Winter, Desert</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrade handling, fuel, nitro, health, magnet, luck, stamina, and top speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Procedurally generated terrain, every run is unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Combo-based trick scoring with multipliers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Daily rewards and score breakdowns after every run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534170/extras/52d8df15d48869b4f9f94b8ef719c4b3.poster.avif?t=1775641886\" aria-label=\"Police car launching high, chaining triple and double frontflips in the spring theme\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534170/extras/52d8df15d48869b4f9f94b8ef719c4b3.webm?t=1775641886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534170/extras/52d8df15d48869b4f9f94b8ef719c4b3.mp4?t=1775641886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got a crazy combo or a ridiculous crash? Post it in the community screenshots. I'd love to see it!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every run is different. Every crash is your fault.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Car Stunt Mania is a physics-based endless racer with procedurally generated terrain. No two runs play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534170/extras/d64357d012b4328503f38d284173f1b5.poster.avif?t=1775641886\" aria-label=\"Yellow van catching big air and landing stunts on hilly terrain\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534170/extras/d64357d012b4328503f38d284173f1b5.webm?t=1775641886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534170/extras/d64357d012b4328503f38d284173f1b5.mp4?t=1775641886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive as far as you can without wrecking your car. Chain frontflips, backflips, long jumps and big airs into combos for bonus coins. Land on both wheels for a perfect landing. Every trick fills your nitro bar, and nitro launches you into even bigger stunts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 vehicles across 6 tiers. 5 environments. 40 upgrade points per car. The runs are short but the progression isn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534170/extras/035dc787b2272158a16efab680774148.poster.avif?t=1775641886\" aria-label=\"Red sports car spinning mid-air and using slam-down for a great landing in the desert\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2534170/extras/035dc787b2272158a16efab680774148.webm?t=1775641886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i